A tiddler whose tags are deliberately out of alphabetical order, so the effect of ''Control Panel'' > ''Settings'' > ''Tag Sorting'' is visible.

The tags were added in this order: `zulu`, `Alpha`, `.private`, `mike`.

* With ''Do not sort'' they appear in that order
* With ''Sort alphabetically'' they appear as `.private`, `Alpha`, `mike`, `zulu`
* With the custom filter `[!prefix[.]]` the `.private` tag disappears here, but stays visible when you edit this tiddler

See [[Customising tag order]].
